    "en": {
      "trackName": "Recess: Minesweeper Solitaire",
      "description": "There is a better kind of break than endlessly swiping through photos and videos.\n\nRecess is a break-time puzzle app that redesigns classic logic puzzles for five-minute work breaks.\n\nSocial media breaks are hard to end. Ads keep pulling your attention away. Suddenly, 30 minutes are gone.\n\nWith Recess, you can take a guilt-free \"game break.\" Its games and modes are designed to wrap up cleanly in short sessions, so your break can end feeling clear. A play timer shows how long you have been playing, so you can decide, \"time to get back.\"\n\n■ Three puzzles for everyday breaks.\n• Minesweeper: Quest Mode, plus luck-free Pure Logic Mode. Boards that can be solved by logic alone make it easy to settle into focused play.\n• Solitaire: The classic card game that is so easy to get absorbed in. Clear Path Mode removes the luck factor, so you can leave bad-deal frustration behind.\n• Block Escape Puzzle: From Easy to Ultimate, with a wide range of stages designed to help your break end cleanly.\n\n■ One-time Premium. No subscription.\nUnlock every level and mode with a single purchase.",
